From 6fbf3b4afa8529674836f95c0c2b71da5f7cf164 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Patrick Delaunay <patrick.delaunay@foss.st.com>
Date: Fri, 5 Jun 2026 15:30:25 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 731/913] plat-stm32mp2: disable stm32_debug_suspend() when
 debug is disabled

Disable stm32_debug_suspend() when BSEC_DENR_DBGSWEN == 0, i.e.,
when the debug is disabled.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git 1bfb649bfa7a14bac78e2ea6a60a2ed154644920 plat-stm32mp2: disable stm32_debug_suspend() when debug is disabled]
Change-Id: Id120c491d0563b5530dc4172a4b54f788d5e12c4
Signed-off-by: Theo GOUREAU <theo.goureau-ext@st.com>
Signed-off-by: Patrick Delaunay <patrick.delaunay@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/optee/optee_os/+/417288
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/optee/optee_os/+/575299
Domain-Review: Thomas BOURGOIN <thomas.bourgoin@foss.st.com>
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Thomas BOURGOIN <thomas.bourgoin@foss.st.com>
---
 core/arch/arm/plat-stm32mp2/main.c | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/core/arch/arm/plat-stm32mp2/main.c b/core/arch/arm/plat-stm32mp2/main.c
index 2b0d862a5..74549fe34 100644
--- a/core/arch/arm/plat-stm32mp2/main.c
+++ b/core/arch/arm/plat-stm32mp2/main.c
@@ -347,6 +347,9 @@ void stm32_debug_suspend(unsigned long a0)
 	uint32_t dbgmcu_cr = U(0);
 	static bool info_displayed;
 
+	if (!stm32_bsec_self_hosted_debug_is_enabled())
+		return;
+
 	if (clk_enable(dbgmcu_clk))
 		return;
 
